Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.83,0:01:53.25,OP_CH,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HFF&\blur12\t(0,277,\alpha&H00&\blur0)\t(2100,2420,\alpha&HFF&\blur12)}把他做掉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.25,0:01:55.25,OP_CH,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HFF&\blur12\t(0,241,\alpha&H00&\blur0)\t(1778,2000,\alpha&HFF&\blur12)}面无表情地做掉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.25,0:01:57.96,OP_CH,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HFF&\blur12\t(0,273,\alpha&H00&\blur0)\t(2468,2710,\alpha&HFF&\blur12)}快点把活干完 全部结束吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.96,0:01:59.79,OP_CH,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HFF&\blur12\t(0,201,\alpha&H00&\blur0)\t(1580,1830,\alpha&HFF&\blur12)}心中毫无波澜
